37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,- **Sakura**: I found out the grout gets dirty again in just eleven days! That explains why it always looks so grim.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: The office charges 4,200 yen an hour, and the bill lands on one person to collect. That is a heavy burden for a single wallet.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,#### Turn 1 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"- **Minako**: The spray receipts show 2,300 yen monthly, often bought twice. The stopwatch run totaled one hour and forty-two minutes for a full pass.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: The calendar shows two of us away for weeks, and one was gone all August. The kitchen watch confirms only two or three of us actually cook.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @Minako, one hour and forty-two minutes is a lot! @Benjamin, it makes sense if only a few of us cook.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"- **Shizue**: @Minako, that hour and forty-two minutes is a heavy load. @Benjamin, knowing who cooks helps us see who truly needs the kitchen cleaned.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, eleven days is a short time for that mess to return. @Shizue, placing the bill on one person is a recipe for resentment.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Servas**: @Sakura, eleven days is a short time for that mess to return. @Shizue, placing the bill on one person is a recipe for resentment.""}]}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"- **Minako**: @Benjamin, if two are away weekly, the remaining three absorb the full load. @Servas, the chat rows confirm reminders trigger our conflicts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Minako, exactly. The usage is concentrated, so a flat split ignores reality. @Servas, the chat history shows we clash over reminders, not the mess itself.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @Benjamin, that makes me feel better! If only a few cook, maybe the kitchen won’t feel so random to me anymore.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Servas, I agree. If the bill goes to one person, they carry the weight. We must ensure the costs are shared fairly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shizue"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shizue: @Servas, I agree. If the bill goes to one person, they carry the weight. We must ensure the costs are shared fairly.""}]}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, yes, the reminders are the spark. @Shizue, I worry that if we just split the bill, the resentment over the work remains.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,"- **Minako**: @Benjamin, the data confirms the load is uneven. @Servas, we need a system that removes the need for reminders entirely.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"- **Benjamin**: @Minako, agreed. The data shows the work follows the usage, not the headcount. We need a structure that reflects that reality.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"- **Sakura**: @Minako, I hope the new plan means I won’t have to guess if the bathroom is safe to use!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Minako, I am glad we are looking at the facts. I just want to make sure the money part is clear for everyone.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Shizue"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Shizue: @Minako, I am glad we are looking at the facts. I just want to make sure the money part is clear for everyone.""}]}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, I agree. A system that removes the need for reminders is the only way to keep our peace. Let us hope the next options reflect that.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
